# Watching TV after a contest win (decomp scripts_contests.s Contests_LobbyOnTransition, scripts_tv_reporter_interviews.s,
# scripts_tv_broadcast.s; scrcmd_tv_broadcast.c, ov6_022465FC.c, tv_segment.c): after the Normal Rank Cool Contest that
# Staravia wins, the lobby shows the reporter (CheckTVInterviewEligible: the contest is pending); A on the reporter, YES,
# the question, the answer (EVERYONE) in the Easy Chat app saves the Contest Hall segment. Then a TV in a house of
# Canalave City at 11:30 on the Sunday, when programme 1 (the interviews) airs: the greeting, the lead-in, the Contest
# Hall segment (the win), then the TV again: the farewell, then a commercial. The save keeps the segment and its play.
from sys-contest-normal-cool.replay
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_CONTEST_HALL_LOBBY 18 14 up
until idle
+0 assert state tv.pending.contest {"species":"platinum:SPECIES_STARAVIA","type":0,"rank":0,"placement":1}
+0 assert state objects[localId=7].x 18
+0 assert state records.score 7
# The reporter: "May I do a quick interview?" YES
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until app easy-chat 600
+1 tap slot:0
+1 tap group:4
+1 tap word:platinum:PeopleWords_Text_Everyone
+1 tap yes
until app none
advance text 600
until idle 600
+0 assert state tv.pending.contest null
+0 assert state tv.interviews[0] {"data":{"kind":"contest","species":"platinum:SPECIES_STARAVIA","type":0,"rank":0,"placement":1,"word":1177},"plays":0}
# TRAINER_SCORE_EVENT_TV_INTERVIEW_GIVEN
+0 assert state records.score 8
